        "created_at": "2015-09-19T04:12:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/48/5774_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>eviltoon wrote:</b><br><blockquote>phantaskippy wrote:<br><blockquote>Big cards. &nbsp;\"I want my next scheme to be small, portable and convenient\" said no villain in this game. &nbsp;Respect the Villainy, go big.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\n&nbsp;Except Plague Rat.\n</blockquote></div>\nI thought that was what he meant by, \"Grrr. Argrrrah!\"<em> *slash*</em>(Turning everyone into monsters is pretty big.  :wink: )\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>But plagues themselves are pretty small! Viruses are very compact, very portable and very convenient!</p>",
